                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unusual VR shooter in which you cannot miss a single shot. Luckily the weapon and its projectile are consistent and can be learned. The targets can be tricky to hit, but they all follow a pattern of movement which you can also learn. It's kind of satisfying to be tracking a target, leading it, waiting for it to make its next turn, which it does and your shot lines up perfectly. Bonus: Its nice holiday setting makes it easy to re-visit this game every holiday season, re-beat it in approx 30 minutes. That's about all the repeat gameplay you'll get here. Could be fun and increase competition if they add a timer that starts after first shot. I received this in a bundle and received that much enjoyment out of it. Thumbs: UP!",
